    <string name="guide_title_1">The home-screen widget</string>
    <string name="guide_body_1">Tap "Add widget" on the main screen (or add it from your phone\'s widget list). You can resize it, and each part of it opens the matching app.</string>
    <string name="guide_title_2">The dashboard</string>
    <string name="guide_body_2">The main screen is a dashboard: weather, events, alarm, timers and more. Tap a card for details, and move or hide cards in Settings.</string>
    <string name="guide_title_3">Settings</string>
    <string name="guide_body_3">Choose what to show, colours, places, alerts and quiet hours. "Smart content" shows only what matters now.</string>
    <string name="guide_title_4">Privacy</string>
    <string name="guide_body_4">Everything stays on the device. Permissions are optional and can be seen and changed in Settings. The network is used only for weather, place search, the map and updates, and only when you ask.</string>
